{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales for the Long Nights is a <strong>tactical roguelike adventure</strong> where survival is never a given. It feels like the world is actively conspiring against you, and to its credit, it\u2019s doing a spectacular job. <strong>As a traveling merchant,</strong> <strong>recruit a team of mercenaries, fight off the many things that want you dead</strong> and try to turn a profit before something eats your team and you have to start again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608730/extras/45a90b5f41234ca737be48e98ad919f3.poster.avif?t=1764082412\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608730/extras/45a90b5f41234ca737be48e98ad919f3.webm?t=1764082412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins. Ogres. A dragon that\u2019s about five minutes away from turning you into a cautionary tale for other travellers... It might feel like the world is actively conspiring against you, but to be fair, it's always like this. Engage in brutal, tactical battles where every ability matters, and victory hinges on strategy, luck, and possibly a bit more luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608730/extras/cb8f517c698aeb32f9fc6eb695ce2a0d.poster.avif?t=1764082412\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608730/extras/cb8f517c698aeb32f9fc6eb695ce2a0d.webm?t=1764082412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every great adventure starts with a <strong>questionable hiring decision</strong>. And here you are, recruiting a band of mercenaries with wildly different skill levels, personal grudges, and at least one active bounty. Will your party emerge victorious, or will their heroic deeds be reduced to the long sigh and shaking head of a (not-so-genuinely) grieving relative?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608730/extras/98b4093de06d4e5103f96046e278e81d.poster.avif?t=1764082412\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608730/extras/98b4093de06d4e5103f96046e278e81d.webm?t=1764082412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the Road Less Paved (Even Though Wagons Do Notoriously Badly Off-Road)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across a vast, unruly world, where no two journeys are the same. Chart a path through deep forests, mountain passes, and places that really should have more warning signs. Every route you choose is a gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608730/extras/b756fb25877bafdd477a351967a9de49.poster.avif?t=1764082412\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608730/extras/b756fb25877bafdd477a351967a9de49.webm?t=1764082412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fumble your way through an increasingly hostile world, you\u2019ll unlock powerful abilities and team synergies that just might prolong your inevitable doom. Experiment, adapt, and enjoy the fleeting moments of feeling like an unstoppable force - before the game not so gently reminds you that hubris is a dangerous thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608730/extras/496ee71e10ee8de0ccf6876fe70b622d.poster.avif?t=1764082412\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608730/extras/496ee71e10ee8de0ccf6876fe70b622d.webm?t=1764082412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where death is always one bad decision away, there\u2019s one thing you can count on\u2014you will amass an ungodly amount of stuff. From enchanted weapons to slightly moldy cheese, everything has a use\u2026 even if that use is \u201cgetting sold to the next merchant with low standards\u201d. Gather rare materials, craft legendary gear, and cobble together the tools of your next victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608730/extras/89f506a321400c7d837ec80aaff3cfd0.poster.avif?t=1764082412\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608730/extras/89f506a321400c7d837ec80aaff3cfd0.webm?t=1764082412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608730?t=1764082412","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608730?t=1764082412","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608730/428cb012fb32d02fec3